<span id="Description"></span>
==Popis==

[[File:PartDesign_MoveFeatureInTree.svg|24px]] [[PartDesign_MoveFeatureInTree/cs|Přesunout prvek za…]], jak je tento příkaz označen v kontextovém menu, umožňuje změnit pořadí objektů v rámci Tělesa. Podporovány jsou náčrtky, referenční geometrie a prvky.

<span id="Usage"></span>
==Použití==

# In the Tree View, select the object(s) to be moved then right-click to open the context menu.
# Select the {{MenuCommand|[[File:PartDesign_MoveFeatureInTree.svg|16px]] Move Feature After…}} option from the context menu.
# In the '''Move Feature After…''' dialog, select the object under which to move the object(s).
# Press {{Button|OK}}.

==Example==

The following three pictures show the same model with a pocket defined on a sketch attached to the datum plane. The features are reordered from one picture to the other. This has the effect that the pocket makes either no hole or makes holes in different pads, depending on the order of the features in the model tree.

